Server init.

>> db := Maria-DB nĳ host: ['localhost'],
	brûkersnamme: ['xo'],
	wachtwurd: ['pass123'],
	databanknamme: ['xobase'],
	ferbine.

>> del := db fraach: ['DELETE FROM book WHERE id > 0'].
{  del útfiere. db befêstigje. } fange: { :e db weromdraaie.  }, begjinne.

>> telle := db fraach: ['SELECT COUNT(*) AS num FROM book'].
telle ophelje: { :row Utfier skriuwe: row num, nije-rigel. }.
